          </div>
          <p class="lede reveal" style="--d:.1s">
            LenticulumLM has no code yet. What it would be built from does: a factor-graph library
            with learned relations, a content-addressed store and a graph editor. Here is what
            exists, what does not, and what could make it fail.
          </p>
