            <h3 class="col-h mono">Open questions</h3>
            <ul class="ticks ticks--limit">{open.map((w) => <li>{w}</li>)}</ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="fineprint mono">
          The open questions come from Lenticulum.jl's own review of the idea,
          <a class="il" href={links.lmNote}>Language Models</a>: a product of experts over diffusion
