          <p class="reveal" style="--d:.1s">
            LenticulumLM is a research bet: that a language model can be a graph you can grow, prune,
            inspect and verify, rather than a checkpoint you can only run. If you fund research, work
            on probabilistic inference, SLAM or diffusion models, or want a model whose knowledge you
            can edit, we would like to hear from you.
          </p>
          <div class="cta reveal" style="--d:.14s">
